        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ceramic plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ceramic plant
Life time of 50 years for buildings and of 25 years for machines is assumed. Dataset refers to a factory with yearly output of 5'000 t of ceramic products.;
UUID: 356388ef-8f73-3766-9eac-8ef6fdde9329
Includes land use and materials used in buildings and machinery as well as their disposal
Location: data from two factories of one producer in Austria
Technology: large scale production plant in Europe.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_356388ef-8f73-3766-9eac-8ef6fdde9329.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
